	quest.5E96E8FCBFCCA50C.quest_desc: ["End seeds are grown nearly the same as Earth, but with Tier 3 Growth Solution. That costs Turbofuel and Carbon with 1 Ender Essence in the Pressurized Reaction Chamber."]
